{"posts":[{"id":"dbrrbd_p57_1401","t":"Hi Corsica, what this homework request to do is:\n\nMark at least 200 caps on your charts - there are so many to see that it won't take long. Draw a box from the cap to where price hit it later. Note how price approached the caps, and how it reacted. If price broke the cap, note what happened next. Was the cap still relevant?\n\nI added RBD to your HW for all the newbie who comes here to look for some suggestion and learn how to complete the HW, as I did in the past.\n\nIMO this HW is important for learn to watch and see the chart in a new way. No one ask us to trade the RBD and DBR here, but if we want there's the classroom thread or our journal.\n\nFor your questions.... Start simple, start the clean homework. All will be clearer in the future. Have a nice day","a":"Al3cs","d":"","n":"#1401","p":57,"im":[],"m":1401},{"id":"dbrrbd_p57_1402","t":"Away\n\noops. You are right, i didn't realise that what I posted was not at the right place for it. Apologies about that and thank you again for taking the time to help us.","a":"corsica","d":"","n":"#1402","p":57,"im":[],"m":1402},{"id":"dbrrbd_p57_1403","t":"hi guys more homework,please free to comment.","a":"K H A N","d":"","n":"#1403","p":57,"im":["b053e6f485102c9d0ebd15be9183b15f960a965f"],"m":1403},{"id":"dbrrbd_p57_1404","t":"hi guys more homework,please free to comment.","a":"K H A N","d":"","n":"#1404","p":57,"im":["1b1ecfbcbf81ed851ded5d63e6c1297d256223b5"],"m":1404},{"id":"dbrrbd_p57_1405","t":"Away\n\nHello Everyone Here are 100 RBD/DBR. I have tried to focus on them and nothing else. I wrote rbd and dbr in order to make the charts looking cleaner. Thank you to all!","a":"corsica","d":"","n":"#1405","p":57,"im":["a24122a2a402e8c301683ff2587746fa62b1d7f5","a724ee123800253ce388882a7bb5a88dc124057a","36ba419c61bff470c03b9751540392fce7a9fe65"],"m":1405},{"id":"dbrrbd_p57_1406","t":"Away\n\nsome more","a":"corsica","d":"","n":"#1406","p":57,"im":["d57c0f558379690fc671038cdbed2fd