"671b7b2466572044b4202e1b4dad227fc2486dd6"],"m":1414},{"id":"dbrrbd_p57_1415","t":"Hi, all\n\nFirst post here. Glad I found this community as this is a great place to learn S/D trading! I finished reading RBD DBR article and started my HW.\n\nAppreciated your comments. Thank you","a":"KimA","d":"","n":"#1415","p":57,"im":["2e63382aa41ab16c8670bd87be406dda4345807d"],"m":1415},{"id":"dbrrbd_p57_1416","t":"K H A N wrote: hi guys more homework,please free to comment.\n\nHIYA KHAN hope you do well, BTW nice work from you here, i am not expert but pay more attention to those bases that in them some important decision made (if price was too cheap or expensive )we expect reaction in those bases in future, an other important thing is FLIP LVLs or SWAP zones, pay attention to them also. here is a note on your chart, keep it up bro.\n\nbest regards SALIVAN","a":"salivan","d":"","n":"#1416","p":57,"im":["1c58beced0cb4c63288102669451d6495fcee33e","671b7b2466572044b4202e1b4dad227fc2486dd6","5b1d9731272d52ee7dc0f9158464320fc2fc491b"],"m":1416},{"id":"dbrrbd_p57_1417","t":"KimA wrote: Hi, all\n\nFirst post here. Glad I found this community as this is a great place to learn S/D trading! I finished reading RBD DBR article and started my HW.\n\nAppreciated your comments. Thank you\n\nHi KimA welcome here,hope we can learn from each other, for your first post that was a great start, just IMO bear in mind why some bases react and other ignored?? look for those bases that some decision made there (if price was too expensive or too cheap ) then look for those bases that some decision made to break a barrier. (RBD&DBR)s that are fresh are more important for us, look at the chart in form of order, try to find out how bigboys can grab more orders ( maybe in fresh bases). here is some not for you\n\nbest regards SALIVAN","a":"salivan","d":"","n":"#1417","p":57,"im":["2e63382aa41ab16c8670bd87be406dda4345807d","8706acf6ce5fd1b48b7cbd9eef29934cd5dde8f9"],"m":1417},{"id":"dbrrbd_p57_1418","t":"Thank you very much Salivan:)\n\nI thought I marked all the RBD/DBR but obviously I missed some.\n\nGreat to know how to find some zone are more important than others because I saw my messy chart and thought we got possible turning points everywhere and had no idea which zone are held or broken.\n\nI need more screen time to get used to the concept as well as continue reading other HW/articles as it looks like all connected each other.\n\nThanks again, really informative....KimA\n\nsalivan wrote:\n\nKimA wrote: Hi, all\n\nFirst post here. Glad I found this community as this is a great place to learn S/D trading! I finished reading RBD DBR article and started my HW.\n\nAppreciated your comments. Thank you","a":"KimA","d":"","n":"#1418","p":57,"im":["2e63382aa41ab16c8670bd87be406dda4345807d","8706acf6ce5fd1b48b7cbd9eef29934cd5dde8f9"],"m":1418},{"id":"dbrrbd_p57_1419","t":"hiya Kima you right, all the market is RBD,DBR and it makes your chart messy, but i offer you look for those bases that some decision made to break a barrier then read all pieces of this puzzle, then do enough HW as you can.after putting all this concepts together then you will see the chart very very clear. hope it makes sense regards SALIVAN","a":"salivan","d":"","n":"#1419","p":57,"im":[],"m":1419},{"id":"dbrrbd_p57_1420","t":"","a":"mostafasevin","d":"","n":"#1420","p":57,"im":["6c8c58d27cbe3a79d45312b6819e2425f8238f6b"],"m":1420},{"id":"dbrrbd_p57_1421","t":"Hi MS welcome here, if you don't mind i wrote some more for you, try to mark all RBD,DBR,DBD,RBD in your chart and post here.\n\nhope it makes sense\n\nSALIVAN","a":"salivan","d":"","n":"#1421","p":57,"im":["40c970c21e71282d38e4c96e17743c4358a46ca5"],"m":1421},{"id":"dbrrbd_p57_1422","t":"Hi to all. I'm new here. this is my homework. please tell me your comment. Thanks...","a":"alireza2297","d":"","n":"#1422","p":57,"im":["2ed05d4388206adf92d6ce4aaf1b12d2f3da97f8"],"m":1422},{"id":"dbrrbd_p57_1423","t":"Hi Alireza welcome here, please press t